rkably stable all year, showing Reed ahead by 18 to 20 points among likely voters, most recently 53 to 33 in late September. All ten expert ratings place the race in the Solid or Safe Democratic column, and prediction markets price Reed's chances at about 99 percent. The race is not competitive.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9966, "margin": 18.16}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9957, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9978, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9949, "margin": 18.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9974, "margin": 19.0}]}